# plugin-map.entries — the declared entry set reachability starts from.
# One repo-relative path per line; `#` starts a comment; every line must exist.
# plugin-map.sh errors when a SKILL.md on disk, hooks/hooks.json or
# scripts/tests-smoke/run-smoke.sh is missing here, or when a listed path is not
# on disk. A node reachable from none of these is an orphan (unless waived in
# waivers.yaml); a node reachable only through run-smoke.sh is test-only.
# "human slash entry" marks the six skills with user-invocable: true (four
# orchestrator/tracker entries + assay and grounded-claims, kept invocable by
# owner ruling 2026-08-31, deviation D-30); every other SKILL.md is reached
# only through a Skill call from one of those.

skills/anvil/SKILL.md                 # human slash entry
skills/assay/SKILL.md                 # human slash entry (D-30)
skills/code-review/SKILL.md
skills/crucible/SKILL.md              # human slash entry
skills/deliverable-review/SKILL.md
skills/design-review/SKILL.md
skills/design-spec/SKILL.md
skills/epic-driven-roadmap/SKILL.md   # human slash entry
skills/grounded-claims/SKILL.md       # human slash entry (D-30)
skills/init/SKILL.md                  # human slash entry

hooks/hooks.json
scripts/tests-smoke/run-smoke.sh
